Package: ggm
Title: A Grammar for Exploring and Presenting Cardiac Electrograms
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Anish S.", "Shah", , "shah.in.boots@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9729-1558"))
Description: Visualization and interaction layer for cardiac
    electrophysiology signal data. 'ggm' (Grammar of Electrograms) builds
    on the 'EGM' data backend to view, annotate, and present
    electrograms. The signal store stays canonical in 'EGM' (WFDB
    byte-seek reads); 'ggm' adds windowed access, a multi-resolution
    overview, and a declarative grammar for animated and print-ready
    figures. Sample index (integer) is the canonical key for storage and
    joins, while time (seconds) is the display unit.
